{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06563","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 十 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四邻竞丰屋，我独好卑室。\n窈窕高台中，时闻抚新瑟。\n狂飙动地起，拔木乃非一。\n相顾始知悲，中心忧且栗。\n蚩蚩命子弟，恨不居高秩。\n日入宾从归，清晨冠盖出。\n中庭有奇树，荣早衰复疾。\n此道犹不知，微言安可述。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}